---
// Hero: copy on the gradient with a single photograph filling the right half.
---

<section
  class="hero-gradient grid min-h-[520px] grid-cols-1 overflow-hidden lg:grid-cols-[0.88fr_1.12fr]"
>
  <div
    class="flex max-w-[720px] flex-col justify-center px-6 pb-12 pt-28 lg:px-12 lg:pt-0"
  >
    <h1
      class="reveal text-[34px] font-extrabold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em] text-white lg:text-[60px]"
    >
      Your day on the water,<br />sorted.
      <span class="text-accent"> All in one place.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="reveal mt-8 max-w-[46ch] text-[20px] leading-relaxed text-white/80 [--reveal-delay:120ms]">
      Rent or list kayaks, paddleboards, jet skis and more from locals near you.
      If it floats, you'll find it here on Paddlme.
    </p>
    <div class="reveal mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3 [--reveal-delay:240ms]">
      <a
        href="/browse"
        class="inline-block cursor-pointer rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-white no-underline transition-[filter] hover:brightness-95"
      >
        Browse listings
      </a>
      <button
        type="button"
        data-auth="signup"
        class="cursor-pointer rounded-full bg-white px-6 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-ocean-950 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        Become a host
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="reveal-fade relative h-[360px] overflow-hidden lg:mt-[72px] lg:h-auto lg:min-h-[648px] [--reveal-delay:150ms]"
  >
    <img
      class="hero-slide is-active"
      src="/kayaking.webp"
      alt="Kayaking on the water"
    />
  </div>
</section>
